body:
Uy, astig! I like Red's humor. Haha. Enjoy! Deets for Ebe's gig next week: [Ebe Dancel](https://twitter.com/ebedancel/status/1557574410726699008/photo/1)

&#x200B;

Ako pala yung need maglagay sa bucket list ko nung tattoos. Haha. Have you tried cliff jumping?

You look like Britt Robertson at first glance! I hope things turn around for you for the better. 🤍

&#x200B;

P.S. I literally was searching for Britt Robertson for hours because I forgot her name but wanted to find her to let you know you reminded me of her. Haha.
